WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Practice adds up in a way you don't notice day to day. Once a week it's worth stopping to reflect on what you've learned.

2
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.767
Here's the week you just had.

3
00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:19.000
Highlights is the short version of the week: a tune you added, a tune that got better, a goal you finished.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.633
Your goals are here too, to reflect on. You can think about what you've completed. This helps you to decide what to do when you plan your next week.

5
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:31.100
Underneath is every practice, along with the notes you made.

6
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:45.233
After you've reflected, you can write a line about how it went — what's coming along, what's stuck.

7
00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:53.367
It goes in the journal with the week, so you can see all of your notes in one place.

8
00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:56.333
And now you can plan the coming week.
